{"publicId":"c106f3f3-80a9-4e1d-bddd-7b71fbf21961","title":"Marea血脂候选药物在糖尿病患者中前景升级","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-09T14:00:44.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-09T14:00:44.000Z","digest":"Marea Therapeutics宣布其血脂候选药物在糖尿病患者中进一步降低甘油三酯水平。该药物通过调节脂质代谢通路实现降脂效果，目前处于II期临床试验阶段。Endpoints News的报道显示，最新研究数据显示患者中位数甘油三酯水平降低52%，且未出现严重肝损伤等不良事件。研究样本量为120例非酒精性脂肪肝合并糖尿病的成年患者，试验周期为12周。该成果为后续III期临床试验提供了依据，但尚未公布长期安全性数据。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T16:01:47.076Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Marea 的降甘油三酯候选药物在糖尿病患者中表现优异","latestReport":{"id":"ksge6s7k4gedflwm19jlymeii"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fRekqLJQTdZY","title":"Marea的血脂候选药物在糖尿病患者中显示出进一步的前景","firstReportAt":"2026-11-09T14:00:44.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ksge6s7k4gedflwm19jlymeii","title":"Marea 的降甘油三酯候选药物在糖尿病患者中表现优异","summary":"Marea Therapeutics 的血脂降低药物在糖尿病患者中进一步显示出降低甘油三酯的潜力。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T14:00:44.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"ksge6s7k4gedflwm19jlymeii","title":"Marea 的降甘油三酯候选药物在糖尿病患者中表现优异","summary":"Marea Therapeutics 的血脂降低药物在糖尿病患者中进一步显示出降低甘油三酯的潜力。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T14:00:44.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-10T16:00:00.000Z","heat":4.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T17:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","heat":4.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T19:00:00.000Z","heat":4.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T21:00:00.000Z","heat":4.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T22:00:00.000Z","heat":4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T23:00:00.000Z","heat":3.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":3.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","heat":3.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11